{"ref":"powerup:might","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":96,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Might is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It affects the damage output of all weapons."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player has 100% base Might before modifications, such as the characters bonuses or PowerUps. The Might in the stat panel is given as the difference to the base Might, meaning that Might stat of +30% equals to 130% total Might, for example. Might modifications from characters, PowerUps, passive items, and arcanas stack additively."]},{"k":"p","c":["The upper limit of total Might after character, PowerUp, and item modifications is 1000%, or +900% in the stats panel."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Might has a further multiplier of 1.25x on ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStrike.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstrike"}," ",{"t":"SpellStrike","r":"weapon:spellstrike"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-TidesOfTheFoscari.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access"},"."]},{"c":["Might also affects the charge ability of ",{"i":"Sprite-Quincy_Morris.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:quincy-morris"}," ",{"t":"Quincy Morris","r":"character:quincy-morris"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Stanley.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:stanley"}," ",{"t":"Stanley","r":"character:stanley"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"}," gets +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," per +10% Might."]}]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["POWER"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+5%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+25%"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Might PowerUp increases Might by 5% per rank, with a maximum rank of 5. At rank 5, it provides +25% Might. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Might"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+5%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+15%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+25%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Might's associated passive item is ",{"i":"Sprite-Spinach.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:spinach"}," ",{"t":"Spinach","r":"passive:spinach"},", which provides +10% Might per level, up to a maximum of +50% Might at level 5."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," also provides +4%, then +3% per level, up to a maximum of +25% at level 8."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}," has a chance of granting a Might stat bonus of +4% upon activation."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Eggs can permanently increase Might by +1% for the character that collected it."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-arcana","title":"From arcana","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," provides +5% Might when chosen per ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"po